| sel. B → val. A | min_match 12, min(k,7), tmax 8 | −1.1% / +8.9% | **0** (162) | 5/108, chat, −0.3…−1.7% (es. P2 ρ0.099 vs t8 −0.4% [−0.8, −0.0]; P1 ρ0.26 controllo −1.7% [−2.6, −0.8]) |

